// ================================================================
// CHENNAI MULTI-TEMPORAL LULC PROJECT
// SCRIPT 05C4B
//
// MANUAL BARREN/FALLOW POLYGON SAMPLING + QA
//
// REQUIRED IMPORT:
// barrenAdd2010
//
// barrenAdd2010 is ONE Geometry import containing 6 polygons.
//
// PURPOSE
// -------
// 1. Split the 6 manually reviewed polygons
// 2. Assign new source IDs 301-306
// 3. Sample the authoritative 2010 predictor stack
// 4. Remove exact pixels already present in current candidate pool
// 5. Check clear observation availability
// 6. Calculate the same 2010-native spectral diagnostics
// 7. Report:
//      - number of pixels per polygon
//      - clear pixels
//      - duplicate pixels
//      - predicted-class distribution
//      - strict automatic-pass count
//
// IMPORTANT
// ---------
// This is QA ONLY.
//
// NO:
// - validation
